'''Pokémon Shorts''' is a series of 12 {{wp|Computer-generated imagery|CGI}}-{{pkmn|animation|animated}} shorts made to promote {{g|Sun and Moon}}. The first one debuted on [https://twitter.com/Pokemon Twitter] on November 22, 2016. The other seven were made available daily from November 24 to 30, 2016. Four of them were later posted on [[The Pokémon Company International]]'s [https://www.youtube.com/user/pokemon YouTube channel] for [[Pokémon Day]] 2017. The series was also posted on {{ytu|PokemonKoreaInc}} from December 18 to 26, 2016. Four more shorts were released monthly from March 9 to June 16, 2021 for the [[Pokémon 25th Anniversary]].

